{
  "title": "Lambda · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "이벤트가 발생할 때 서버를 직접 운영하지 않고 코드를 실행합니다.",
  "main": "<nav aria-label=\"현재 위치\" class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>Lambda</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open=\"\"><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/#guide-1\">이벤트에서 코드 실행까지</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/#guide-2\">반복 실행과 실행 시간 고려하기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/#visual\">구성 한눈에 보기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/#notes\">각주</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>컴퓨팅</span><span>32 / 62</span></div><h1>Lambda</h1></header><section class=\"overview\" id=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>Lambda는 <strong>요청이나 이벤트에 맞춰 코드를 실행하는 서비스</strong>입니다. 서버를 직접 만들고 유지하는 대신 실행할 코드와 메모리, 권한 등을 설정합니다.</p><p>파일 업로드 후 이미지 변환, API 요청 처리, 정기 작업처럼 필요할 때 실행되는 작업에 적합합니다. 실행 요청이 늘어나면 여러 실행 환경으로 처리량을 늘릴 수 있습니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-1\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"function-runtime-and-handler\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"synchronous-and-asynchronous-invocation\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"event-source-mapping\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"memory-timeout-and-concurrency\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"reserved-and-provisioned-concurrency\"></span><h2>이벤트에서 코드 실행까지</h2><p>S3 업로드 알림, API Gateway, SQS, EventBridge 등이 실행의 계기가 될 수 있습니다. 함수는 전달받은 이벤트 데이터를 읽고 필요한 처리를 수행합니다.</p><p>실행 역할로 AWS 서비스 접근 권한을 부여합니다. 데이터베이스 접속 정보는 Secrets Manager 같은 서비스에서 읽고, 처리 결과는 S3나 데이터베이스에 저장합니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"execution-role-and-vpc-access\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"versions-aliases-and-deployment\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"snapstart-and-execution-reuse\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"lambda-managed-instances\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"durable-functions\"></span><h2>반복 실행과 실행 시간 고려하기</h2><p>호출 방식에 따라 실패한 요청이 다시 전달될 수 있으므로 같은 이벤트를 여러 번 처리해도 결과가 잘못되지 않도록 멱등성<sup><a aria-label=\"각주 1\" class=\"concept-note-ref\" href=\"#note-1\" id=\"note-ref-1\" role=\"doc-noteref\">[1]</a></sup>을 고려합니다.</p><p>함수의 실행 시간, 메모리, 동시 실행 한도와 초기 시작 지연을 검토합니다. 실행 사이에 반드시 보존할 데이터는 함수의 메모리가 아닌 외부 저장소에 보관합니다. 긴 작업은 컨테이너나 다른 실행 방식도 비교합니다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" id=\"visual\"><figure class=\"diagram concept-diagram\"><figcaption><b>파일 업로드 후 자동 처리</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><ol class=\"concept-flow\"><li><strong>S3 업로드</strong><span>새 파일 이벤트</span></li><li><strong>Lambda 실행</strong><span>이미지 변환 코드</span></li><li><strong>결과 저장</strong><span>변환 파일을 S3에 보관</span></li></ol><p class=\"diagram-note\">코드를 실행할 때 필요한 권한과 실패 시 재처리 방식을 함께 설정합니다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"scenario\" id=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>사용자가 사진을 업로드하면 Lambda가 작은 미리보기 이미지를 생성합니다. 원본과 처리 결과는 S3에 저장하고 같은 업로드 이벤트의 중복 처리를 방지합니다.</p></section><section class=\"concept-notes\" id=\"notes\" role=\"doc-endnotes\"><h2>각주</h2><ol><li id=\"note-1\"><strong>멱등성</strong> — 같은 요청을 여러 번 실행해도 한 번 실행한 것과 같은 결과가 되도록 만드는 성질입니다. 요청 ID를 기록해 중복 결제를 막는 방식 등이 있습니다. <a aria-label=\"각주 1의 본문으로 돌아가기\" class=\"concept-note-back\" href=\"#note-ref-1\">↩</a></li></ol></section><section class=\"references\" id=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/lambda/latest/dg/welcome.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">What is AWS Lambda? ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-2\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/lambda/latest/dg/lambda-managed-instances.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Lambda Managed Instances ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-3\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/lambda/latest/dg/durable-configuration.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Configure Lambda durable functions ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section class=\"related-questions\" id=\"practice\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q036/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"1\" data-question=\"Q036\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q036\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q036</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q036/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An application runs an image transformation that takes a few seconds whenever a file is uploaded. Which option avoids managing servers directly?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q036\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon RDS Multi-AZ</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q036\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Lambda</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q036\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An always-on dedicated EC2 instance only</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q036\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Transit Gateway</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/\">Lambda</a>는 이벤트 기반의 짧은 코드 실행에 알맞다. 실행 한도와 동시성을 점검한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/\">Lambda</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"3\" data-question=\"Q074\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q074\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q074</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q074/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants to filter EC2 instance state-change events and send matching events to Lambda using a Classic event bus and rules. Which service provides this capability?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q074\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An EBS snapshot</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q074\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q074\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">CloudFront caching</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q074\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EventBridge</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eventbridge/\">EventBridge</a> 규칙이 이벤트 패턴을 걸러 대상에 전달한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eventbridge/\">EventBridge</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/\">Lambda</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0\" data-question=\"Q076\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q076\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q076</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q076/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A workflow must explicitly handle branching, retries, and compensation across payment, inventory reservation, and shipment creation. Which service should be used?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q076\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Step Functions</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q076\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon Route 53</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q076\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">EBS gp3</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q076\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">A network ACL</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/step/\">Step Functions</a>는 다단계 워크플로의 상태·분기·재시도를 관리한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/step/\">Step Functions</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/\">Lambda</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q077\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q077\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q077</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q077/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A mobile application calls Lambda functions through an HTTPS API and needs authentication and request throttling. Which front-end service should it use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q077\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Transit Gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q077\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q077\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon API Gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q077\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Glacier</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/\">API Gateway</a>는 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">엔드포인트</a>와 인증·제한 등을 제공한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/apigw/\">API Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/\">Lambda</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2,3\" data-question=\"Q088\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q088\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q088</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q088/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Lambda functions connect to a private RDS database. Which TWO services address connection spikes and secure storage of credentials?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q088\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A Route 53 weighted record</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q088\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Glacier</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q088\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Secrets Manager</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q088\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon RDS Proxy</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q088\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"4\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">An Elastic IP address</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C, D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/#rds-proxy\">RDS Proxy</a>는 DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> 연결을 풀링하고 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/\">Secrets Manager</a>는 비밀 값을 관리한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/\">Lambda</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/\">Secrets Manager</a></div></article></section><nav aria-label=\"용어 이동\" class=\"sequence\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/\">이전 용어 <b>KMS</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">다음 용어 <b>NAT Gateway</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
